 source="#source-59298-59304">かる</seg><choice source="#source-59304-59313"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59316-59322">しく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59322-59346"><rb>斷定</rb><rt>だんてい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59346-59361">することは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59361-59379"><rb>愼</rb><rt>つゝし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59379-59400">まねばならぬ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59400-59448"><rb>磐梯山破裂</rb><rt>ばんだいざんはれつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59448-59451">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59451-59466"><rb>跡</rb><rt>あと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59466-59472">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59472-59487"><rb>大</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59487-59493">きな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59493-59526"><rb>蒸氣孔</rb><rt>じようきこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59526-59529">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59529-59544"><rb>殘</rb><rt>のこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59544-59550">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59550-59586"><rb>火山作用</rb><rt>かざんさよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59586-59589">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59589-59604"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59604-59613">もなほ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59613-59628"><rb>盛</rb><rt>さか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59628-59646">んであるが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59646-59670"><rb>眉山</rb><rt>まゆやま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59670-59673">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59673-59694"><rb>場合</rb><rt>ばあひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59694-59700">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59700-59715"><rb>毫</rb><rt>ごう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59715-59718">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-